index 00000000000..f53b39f5116
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/11783.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Plugins installed in editable mode (:pep:`660`) are now marked for assertion rewriting again.
+
+Such installs do not record the package's Python files in the distribution metadata, so pytest found no modules to rewrite and assertions inside the plugin lost their introspection. The plugin's entry point is now used as a fallback in that case.
